.TH SDE-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-settings \- settings for the Selviana Desktop Environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-settings
[\-\-page \fIname\fR] [\-\-apply] [\-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-settings\fR changes the theme (light or dark), accent color, interface size (100 to 200 %), text size, icon theme and wallpaper; the panel style, width, position, size, auto-hide, clock and pinned applications; the Action Center clock, greeting and tile colors; desktop icons; notifications; display resolution and arrangement (with an automatic revert after 15 seconds); keyboard layouts, key repeat, mouse and touchpad. Changes apply immediately to running SDE programs.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-page " name"
Open a page: home (overview), appearance, panel, desktop, action-center, notifications, display, input, suite, system or about. The default is home.
.TP
.B \-\-apply
Apply the saved display, keyboard and pointer settings and exit (run by \fBsde-session\fR(1) at login).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sde/session.log
Messages of the current session (the previous one is kept as \fIsession.log.old\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-notifyd (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop/issues
